      <dc:description>Several damaged cars are parked on an overgrown patch of ground beside a paved road that runs under an overpass. The foreground features rough stone containers surrounded by tall grass and weeds. In the background, trees line both sides of the roadway beneath the bridge structure.</dc:description>
